      "value": "I like this as a feature it could also be used to warn when initiating a vote to kick but would probably be more of a standardized list of reasons for the initiation since you need more than a certain number of people to initialize the kick and using the one that has the most count for the reason sounds like it could be very useful but as for the instance leaving it as an optional feature to leave a message with the kick also seems good.",
