      "value": "@{64fa34043f66e8201c1b28ee|full_name}  Is VRCx TOS Friendly?   And why would VRC put out Public APIs an then have a TOS that basically says don't use those?\n\nAsk yourself, why is there so many Crashers and Script Kiddies of late, any would VRC ignore this?  Why is the 'Leader of Laughing Coffin' have 250+ alternate accounts over the past two years?  Have you done a racism check on display names, there are 120 accounts less per month now thanks to the one button reporting the tool has and when I go cleaning the rosters.\n\nMy philosophy is we are Shadow IT for all the things that the Company fails to address and fund.  And when corps get shadow IT they have a problem of not listing to their workers.\n\nThe 'TOS \"out\"' here is that the Group Owner is always in control over how they moderate and what they moderate.  From having audit trails and reports of who and what their moderators are moderating, to historical reports of instance attendance, the tools we provide focus on the needs of the group, providing them the analysis of emerging threats to their community. \n\nSo yeah, they know about me from the 9-100 Trust & Safety reports I do per day....  I have 3K T&S Messages in my mailbox ATM.  They tolerate me as I do their work for them.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
